# TAILS-M-Z: one frame per editor card M-Z whose code is in dev but never had a frame (TAILS-AUDIT-2, 10-29).
# Cards: UI-LAYOUT UI-SWITCHER UI-TEXTEDIT TAGS TEX-SRGB SEQ-FILTER SCAL-UX TOD-SPLIT WIND-SRC VFX-10 VFX-16
# VFX-MODULE-ASSET SOUND-ASSET MAT-AO-ONEHOME MAT-INT-PARAM. Writes: the 18 FieldBarn ORM packs set Linear in place (TEX-SRGB content) and a New VFX Module file.
# TAGS: GameplayTagContainer has no component carrying it (sym.sh --refs: only GameplayTag.hpp) -> no Details frame possible.
# SOUND-ASSET: Projects/Desert/Content has no .desound -> no Content Browser frame possible.
# UI clicks are window points (shot-window pixel / 2); the viewport image starts at (324,145) in this layout.
Дано run Quality "Quality: ResolutionScale Epic"
# --- UI-LAYOUT: MainMenu canvas laid out from the asset (anchors, layout groups, cards)
Дано run Scene "Open Scene MainMenu.desce"
Дано run Action "Play from Here"
Дано advance 1
Тогда-вид ui_layout MainMenu: logo top-left, six nav buttons in a column, profile/server/news cards anchored right, bottom bar with ticker and hotkeys
# --- UI-SWITCHER: SETTINGS pushes Screen_Settings; tabs switch Video/Audio pages; Escape pops back to Main
Когда input click - 449,493
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид ui_switcher_0_settings the Settings screen over the menu: VIDEO tab active, Resolution list page
Когда input click - 1003,462
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид ui_switcher_1_audio the AUDIO tab active: Volume 80% page replaces the Resolution list
Когда input key - - Escape
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид ui_switcher_2_escape Escape popped back to the Main screen: the nav column and cards are back
Когда run Action Stop
# --- UI-TEXTEDIT: the InputField takes focus, caret, Backspace and arrows edit "typed text"
Дано run Scene "Open Scene UI_ElementProbe.desce"
Дано run Action "Play from Here"
Дано advance 0.5
Когда input click - 707,711
Когда input key - - Backspace
Когда input key - - Backspace
Когда input key - - Left
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид ui_textedit the InputField focused (outlined), text "typed te" after two Backspaces, caret one left of the end
Когда run Action Stop
# --- TEX-SRGB: texture preview with its colour-space (sRGB / linear) row
Когда run Open "Environments/FieldBarn/Meshes/boulder_01/textures/boulder_01_diff_2k.detex"
Тогда tex_srgb_diffuse the texture editor: albedo preview, sRGB on
# TEX-SRGB content: the 18 FieldBarn packs were created Unspecified (= sRGB) before PackTextureChannels stated the
# slot's space; each is set Linear in place (TextureViewerDocument ColorSpace -> Assets::SetTextureColorSpace).
