# --- SEQ-FILTER: Sequencer with its track filters
Когда run Open "Sequences/Intro.dseq"
Тогда seq_filter the Sequencer of Intro.dseq with the track filter control
Когда run Action "Close All Documents"
# --- SCAL-UX: the Scalability panel
Когда run Panel "Open Scalability"
Тогда scal_ux the Scalability panel: Overall + group sliders incl. PathTracing, Basic rows, Advanced folded
# --- TOD-SPLIT + WIND-SRC: the Sky's Time of Day component and the Wind Source entity in Details
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Clouds_Showcase.desce"
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Sky"
Тогда tod_split Details of Sky: a separate Time of Day component (time, day length, latitude/longitude, date, north offset)
Когда run "Level Viewport" "Select None"
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Wind Source"
Тогда wind_src Details of Wind Source: the Wind Source component (direction, speed, gusts) driving the clouds
# --- VFX-16 + VFX-10: Particle Debugger on the Campfire; Spawn from Channel on the Impacts demo
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Когда run Panel "Open Particle Debugger"
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 1
Тогда vfx16_debugger the Particle Debugger: Campfire's emitters with live particle counts / stats
Когда run Action Stop
Когда run Open "VFX/Demo/Impact.dfx"
Тогда vfx10_channel the Impact system's emitter with a Spawn from Channel module bound to a VFX Data Channel
Когда run Action "Close All Documents"
# --- MAT-AO-ONEHOME + MAT-INT-PARAM
Дано run Scene "Open Scene NRM_Witness.desce"
Когда run Open "Materials/M_NormalWitness.demat"
Тогда mat_ao_onehome the material editor of M_NormalWitness: one AO Strength row (UE Ambient Occlusion), no OcclusionStrength
Когда run View "View mode: Ambient Occlusion"
Тогда-вид mat_ao_view the Ambient Occlusion view mode of NRM_Witness
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Action "Close All Documents"
Дано run Scene "Open Scene MAT_ProbeIntParam.desce"
# The editor camera is not the scene Camera entity: aim it at the five probes (x -400..400, y 20, z 0) from the Camera entity spot.
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,60,1100
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.03,-1
Тогда-вид mat_int_param five probe meshes, each a different integer Mode of one material (0 / 1 / default 2 / 3 / 1 Darken) - visibly different
Когда run Quality "Quality: ResolutionScale High"
# --- VFX-MODULE-ASSET (last: refused on 10-29, VFXModuleFormat.cpp:174 round-trip)
Когда run Assets "New VFX Module"
Тогда vfx_module_asset a new .dfxmod asset created in the Content Browser (and its editor)
